{
    "id":  10282,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "INTEGRATED SQUARE LED CONNECTOR - ARTISTIC - 2W OSRAM CHIP - Exclusive and Customizable Ceilings",
    "reference":  "SC-CW-91710-57K",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSQUARE INTEGRATED LED CONNECTOR of 2W with OSRAM chip\u003c/strong\u003e has been specifically \u003cstrong\u003edesigned for use in ARTISTIC linear strips. Thanks to its square shape\u003c/strong\u003e, it is possible to connect up to four strips continuously. This product offers exclusive and customizable lighting for ceilings, allowing you to create unique and attractive environments in any space. Additionally, it stands out for its easy installation and interconnection, as it includes all necessary accessories. One of the most outstanding features of this luminaire is that the ends allow the passage of light, creating a continuous visual effect and allowing you to create a wide variety of design visual sensations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eINTEGRATED SQUARE LED CONNECTOR - ARTISTIC - 2W OSRAM CHIP - Exclusive and Customizable Ceilings\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe integrated square LED connector with 2W OSRAM chip\u003c/strong\u003e is an excellent choice for those looking to illuminate their spaces with style and elegance. This product has been specifically designed for use in ARTISTIC linear strips, offering exclusive and customizable lighting for ceilings, allowing for unique and attractive environments in any space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne of the main advantages of the integrated square LED connector of 2W is its easy assembly and interconnection, as it includes all the necessary accessories for installation. In addition, its integrated design allows for a smooth and unified connection between ARTISTIC linear strips, providing uniform and uninterrupted lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe integrated square LED connector of 2W stands out for its latest generation LED technology with OSRAM chip. This ensures bright and durable lighting with low energy consumption, making it an ecological and economical option compared to other conventional luminaires. Additionally, the square shape of the connector allows for linking up to four strips continuously, providing homogeneous and uniform lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnother outstanding feature of the integrated square LED connector of 2W is its ability to create a variety of visual design sensations. The ends allow light to pass through, creating a continuous visual effect on the luminaire that provides an immersive and unique experience, adapting to any style of decoration. The luminaire is ideal for use in innovative and creative designs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn summary, the integrated square LED connector of 2W with OSRAM chip is an excellent option for those looking to illuminate their spaces with a versatile luminaire, easy to install and offering customizable design options. With its easy installation, uniform lighting, and customizable design options, it is a durable and versatile option for any type of space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eApplications of the LED SQUARE CONNECTOR - ARTISTIC - 2W OSRAM CHIP - Exclusive and customizable ceilings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWarehouses\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorkshops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFactories\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eParking lots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClinics\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE SALE, including the technical specifications of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
